# TrueBearing .gitignore
#
# The human actor stages with a blind `git add .`, so this file is the only
# thing standing between a stray artifact and the public history. Entries for a
# milestone's tooling are added BEFORE that milestone starts, not after.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored: go.sum, .terraform.lock.hcl, .env.example.
# All three must be committed for a clean clone to build and deploy reproducibly.

# --- Go build output ---
/truebearing
/truebearing.exe
/server
/server.exe
/bin/
/dist/
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# --- Go tooling ---
*.test
coverage.out
coverage.html
/vendor/
go.work
go.work.sum

# --- Environment and credentials ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519
credentials.json
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml

# --- Terraform (M4). State files embed provider credentials and resource secrets. ---
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json

# --- Kubernetes (M4) ---
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig.yaml
kubeconfig.yml
*-secret.generated.yaml

# --- Web UI (M5) ---
node_modules/
.vite/
.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Load testing and local telemetry (M4, M5) ---
k6-results*.json
loadtest/results/
prometheus-data/
grafana-data/

# --- Local runtime state ---
pgdata/
tmp/
*.pid
*.log

# --- Licensed standards library, defence in depth ---
# These live only at the rise root, outside every repository. This entry exists
# so that a copy accidentally placed here can never be staged.
standards/
*.pdf

# --- IDE ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
